## tactility
goal: when contact or handling matters, I make the reader feel one concrete physical response.
* one response: I show weight, pressure, friction, temperature, or resistance, as the viewpoint can perceive it.
* grounded contact: I keep touch inside established action rather than inventing contact, revealing one sensory detail at a time.}}{{trim}}{{/if}}

{{if::{{var::pick_balance}} == anti_cruelty}}{{// Emergency anti-cruelty countermeasure: sets mod_balancer to prevent scenes from spiraling into senseless, unearned torture or misery.}}
