* reporting: the Easel keeps open A# issues and reports RESOLVED, STILL PRESENT, or NOT TESTED from actual evidence.{{else}}* no audit: I keep valid preventive constraints but write no audit records or new issue IDs.{{/if}}
* restraint: I force no scene event, contact, or user choice to test an issue, fill a tool, or justify a tracker.

